1581
01:10:13.000 --> 01:10:14.680
And then we had snow.

1582
01:10:14.680 --> 01:10:19.720
We had snow with this, like, amazing drumming as a backdrop.

1583
01:10:20.220 --> 01:10:20.780
Incredible!

1584
