I asked Randy if we used snow business again.

1585
01:10:23.960 --> 01:10:26.240
And he said no, not this time.

1586
01:10:26.240 --> 01:10:30.180
It was Ron Neri's group ANA Special Effects in Van Nuys.

1587
01:10:30.180 --> 01:10:35.000
He said, in order to get that snow in our parking lot,

1588
01:10:35.220 --> 01:10:38.660
