1590
01:10:44.280 --> 01:10:44.900
Two!

1591
01:10:45.180 --> 01:10:45.760
Wow!

1592
01:10:46.060 --> 01:10:49.360
And then Ron's team put the ice through an industrial chipper,

1593
01:10:49.620 --> 01:10:52.400
and it, like, shot it into the air.

1594
01:10:53.080 --> 01:10:56.480
He said, we shot that scene on a Friday night,

1595
01:10:56.480 --> 01:10:59.540
and it had been 78 degrees that day.

1596
01:11:00.020 --> 01:11:03.780
He said all of the snow effects for this episode,

1597
01:11:04.160 --> 01:11:07.880
filling the parking lot as well as that little snowfall behind our windows,

1598
01:11:08.140 --> 01:11:12.220
that cost $36,000 for snow.

1599
01:11:12.420 --> 01:11:16.120
For snow on a day where it was almost 80 degrees.

1600
01:11:16.700 --> 01:11:19.740
You know, it's always fascinating to me when Randy shares with us

1601
01:11:19.740 --> 01:11:22.120
