1602
01:11:22.400 --> 01:11:24.560
Because it's like...

1603
01:11:24.560 --> 01:11:26.180
He had to budget all of that.

1604
01:11:26.340 --> 01:11:26.640
Yeah.

1605
01:11:26.840 --> 01:11:30.480
And the budget for each episode does not change week to week,

1606
01:11:30.580 --> 01:11:31.660
