1610
01:11:37.400 --> 01:11:41.240
He needed to get the geese and the swans and the special prop

1611
01:11:41.240 --> 01:11:43.400
and the snow and the drumline

1612
01:11:43.400 --> 01:11:47.480
and make it all cost the same as an episode that didn't even have all those things.

1613
01:11:47.640 --> 01:11:47.860
Right.

1614
01:11:48.080 --> 01:11:49.500
It's really fascinating to me.

1615
01:11:49.840 --> 01:11:51.240
But you know I love a spreadsheet.

1616
01:11:51.440 --> 01:11:52.180
I know you do.

